WEBVTT

00:00:29.124 --> 00:00:30.916
I'm not a doctor;

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.117
I'm a chef,

00:00:32.141 --> 00:00:34.663
I don't have expensive equipment

00:00:34.687 --> 00:00:35.757
or medicine.

00:00:35.781 --> 00:00:38.026
I use information, education.

00:00:39.265 --> 00:00:42.242
I profoundly believe
that the power of food

00:00:42.266 --> 00:00:45.441
has a primal place in our homes

00:00:45.465 --> 00:00:49.916
that binds us to the best bits of life.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:57.230
We have an awful, awful reality right now.

00:00:58.519 --> 00:01:01.495
America, you're at the top of your game.